    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-mollĭo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ītum,
			4, v. a., <i>to soften
			beforehand</i> (post - Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praemollitus sulcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					2, 9, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Tard. 4, 3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to soften</i> or <i>mollify beforehand</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 4,
				3, 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">judicum mentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					5, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
